                  Auto Loan Calculator
                </h3>
                <div class="px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 text-green-800 dark:text-green-200 text-xs font-medium rounded-full">
                  Available
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
                Vehicle loan analysis with trade-in value, sales tax, registration fees, and early payoff scenarios. Includes GAP insurance and extended warranty options.
